WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.387
This paper delivers the first collective certified
robustness scheme for graph neural

00:00:05.467 --> 00:00:07.638
networks against injection attacks.

00:00:07.718 --> 00:00:12.012
The authors cast certification as a worst-case
optimization problem,

00:00:12.092 --> 00:00:15.486
a binary integer quadratic constrained linear program,

00:00:15.566 --> 00:00:21.467
and then introduce a customized linearization that
relaxes this hard program into an ordinary

00:00:21.547 --> 00:00:24.426
linear program that can be solved efficiently.

00:00:24.506 --> 00:00:29.186
The result is almost model-agnostic: it works for
any message-passing GNN,

00:00:29.266 --> 00:00:34.460
and it buys huge gains in certified performance at
very little computational cost.
